WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.801 --> 00:00:03.202
You're not appreciating
my situation!

00:00:03.302 --> 00:00:05.271
JEFF GREENE: You're not
giving respect to my appre--

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:07.173
-(LAUGHING)
-DIRECTOR: And cut.

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:09.042
♪ (UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:10.376 --> 00:00:12.278 line:0%
Ha. Who's most likely
to break during a scene?

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:14.280 line:0%
That's easy. Larry.
Every single time.

00:00:14.447 --> 00:00:17.350 line:0%
Larry will always break first.

00:00:17.483 --> 00:00:19.552 line:0%
Even when Larry is smirking
or laughing,

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:20.420
<i>I try to keep my composure.</i>

00:00:20.887 --> 00:00:23.255
I had a lady give me a wedgie
with my own goddamn Johnson.

00:00:23.455 --> 00:00:24.457
(LAUGHS)

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:28.395
-MAN: That's amazing.
-Say that again.

00:00:29.762 --> 00:00:32.465
-Oh, fantastic!
-Right?

00:00:34.934 --> 00:00:36.869
SUSIE ESSMAN:
<i>Watching Larry laughing...</i>

00:00:37.036 --> 00:00:38.471
(LAUGHING)

00:00:38.671 --> 00:00:40.774
<i>...even though I get annoyed
 at him sometimes,</i>

00:00:40.907 --> 00:00:42.208
'cause he's ruining
all my best takes,

00:00:42.374 --> 00:00:44.878
<i>making him laugh is one of
the greatest joys of my life,</i>

00:00:44.944 --> 00:00:45.878
watching him break up.

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:48.548
Did I not just say to you
that I appreciate--

00:00:48.614 --> 00:00:49.482
Are you getting appre--

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:52.685
-(LAUGHING)
-(CELLPHONE RINGS)

00:00:54.654 --> 00:00:55.721
Hold on one second.

00:00:55.955 --> 00:00:58.224
♪ (MUSIC CONCLUDES) ♪

